    },
    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #36 Post-Mortem & Parameter Mutation\nForensic analysis of Cycle #36 (PF: 0.75, Net P&L: \u20b9-26.06, Fees: \u20b946.10) revealed that statutory brokerage and tax drag exceeded gross trading losses, exacerbated by premature breakeven triggers (Trade #8) and stagnant late-session entries (Trades #9, #11). Furthermore, the `0.45%` minimum stop-loss proved vulnerable to standard mid-morning mean-reversion noise between 10:15 and 11:15 IST. To rectify this, we are widening `min_sl_pct` to `0.60%` to give trades structural breathing room, raising `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` to `2.35x` to filter out low-conviction morning traps, delaying `breakeven_trigger_r` to `1.25R` to prevent choking winning trends into fee-induced losses, and scaling `min_target_pct` to `1.35%` to preserve asymmetric positive expectancy."
